---
import "@fontsource-variable/dm-sans";
import "../styles/site.css";

const repo = "https://github.com/Jayhgth/PilotPrincess3";
const downloads = {
  mac: `${repo}/releases/latest/download/Pilot-Princess-mac-arm64.dmg`,
  windows: `${repo}/releases/latest/download/Pilot-Princess-win-x64.exe`,
  windowsArm: `${repo}/releases/latest/download/Pilot-Princess-win-arm64.exe`
};
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0d0f" />
    <meta name="description" content="Pilot Princess is an open-source desktop academic planner with local Codex automation." />
    <title>Pilot Princess | Academic planning, directed by you</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grid-light" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <header class="site-nav shell">
      <a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="/pilot-princess-mark.svg" alt="" /><span>Pilot Princess</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="#product">Product</a>
        <a href="#open-source">Open source</a>
        <a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a>
        <a class="nav-download" data-smart-download href={downloads.mac}>Download</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero shell">
        <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="float-chip chip-one" aria-hidden="true"><span>✓</span> Prerequisites checked</div>
        <div class="float-chip chip-two" aria-hidden="true"><span>4.63</span> projected GPA</div>
        <div class="float-chip chip-three" aria-hidden="true"><span>↗</span> Degree overlap found</div>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Open-source academic planning</p>
        <h1>Plan the whole path.<br /><em>Change it in a sentence.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Verified course data, four-year plan versions, and local Codex automation in one private desktop workspace.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary-download" data-smart-download href={downloads.mac}><span class="platform-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg data-platform-mac viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.1 12.5c0-2.4 2-3.6 2.1-3.7a4.6 4.6 0 0 0-3.6-2c-1.5-.2-3 .9-3.8.9-.8 0-2-1-3.3-.9a4.9 4.9 0 0 0-4.1 2.5c-1.8 3-.5 7.6 1.2 10.1.8 1.2 1.8 2.6 3.1 2.5 1.2-.1 1.7-.8 3.2-.8s1.9.8 3.2.8c1.3 0 2.2-1.2 3-2.4a10.9 10.9 0 0 0 1.4-2.9 4.3 4.3 0 0 1-2.4-4.1ZM14.6 5.2A4.4 4.4 0 0 0 15.7 2a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3 1.5 4.2 4.2 0 0 0-1.1 3.1 3.7 3.7 0 0 0 3-1.4Z" /></svg><svg class="platform-windows" data-platform-windows viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 4.8 10.5 3.8v7.4H3V4.8Zm8.5-1.1L21 2.4v8.8h-9.5V3.7ZM3 12.2h7.5v7.5L3 18.7v-6.5Zm8.5 0H21V21l-9.5-1.3v-7.5Z" /></svg></span><span><strong data-download-label>Download for macOS</strong><small>Apple silicon</small></span></a>
          <a class="secondary-action" href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View source ↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">Free and open source. Codex account and Supabase sign-in required.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="product-stage shell" id="product" aria-label="Pilot Princess dashboard preview">
        <div class="stage-shadow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <figure class="dashboard-preview-frame">
          <img src="/dashboard-preview.png" alt="Pilot Princess dashboard showing diploma progress, GPA, courses, and associate degree planning." width="1600" height="1000" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
        </figure>
      </section>

      <section class="value-strip shell"><p>One workspace for the decisions that usually live in five tabs.</p><div><span>Four-year plans</span><span>Diploma progress</span><span>College degrees</span><span>GPA scenarios</span></div></section>

      <section class="source-section shell" id="open-source">
        <div><p class="eyebrow"><span></span> Open by design</p><h2>Inspect the planner you depend on.</h2><p>The desktop shell, planning engine, source provenance, and Pilot tool contracts are public. Student data remains protected by Supabase row-level security.</p><a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore the repository ↗</a></div>
        <div class="terminal"><header><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>Terminal</span></header><pre><code><b>$</b> codex login
<em>›</em> Opening browser for authentication...
<strong>✓</strong> Signed in with your Codex account

<b>$</b> open "Pilot Princess.app"
<strong>✓</strong> Local app-server ready</code></pre></div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer class="shell"><a class="brand" href="#top"><img src="/pilot-princess-mark.svg" alt="" /><span>Pilot Princess</span></a><p>Open-source academic planning.</p><div><a href={repo}>GitHub</a><a href={`${repo}/releases`}>Releases</a><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.md`}>Docs</a></div></footer>

    <script is:inline define:vars={{ downloads }}>
      const isWindows = navigator.userAgent.includes("Windows");
      const smartDownloads = document.querySelectorAll("[data-smart-download]");
      const label = document.querySelector("[data-download-label]");
      if (isWindows) {
        smartDownloads.forEach((link) => link.setAttribute("href", downloads.windows));
      }
      if (isWindows && label) {
        label.textContent = "Download for Windows";
        const heroDownload = label.closest("[data-smart-download]");
        heroDownload?.querySelector("small")?.replaceChildren("x64 installer");
        heroDownload?.querySelector("[data-platform-mac]")?.classList.add("platform-hidden");
        heroDownload?.querySelector("[data-platform-windows]")?.classList.remove("platform-windows");
      }
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
